              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nothing? (rien.) None? (aucun / aucune.) Neither? (non plus.) Which one? (lequel / laquelle.) Anything at all? (n'importe quoi.) Already? (déjà.) Recently? (récemment.) The day before yesterday? (avant-hier.) Formerly? (autrefois.) To happen? (se produire.)"
